#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""rec-gui — Modern Qt desktop manager for rec-cli v1.4.0.

Features:
- Live process manager (view/pause/resume/mark/stop/start/cancel/kill parallel sessions & SSH panes)
- Visual terminal picker (toggle Kitty, Tabby, Alacritty, WezTerm, Ghostty, Foot, Konsole, GNOME Terminal, or All)
- Instant-save settings (auto/4K/Reels resolution, speed, max length, theme, window frame, secret redaction, Reels copy)
- Clips library browser (filter, play, export GIF, extract thumbnail, open folder, delete)
- Clean Dark & Light themes with 1-click toggle
"""

